<title>USA: North Pittsburgh Systems increases div.</title>
<headline>North Pittsburgh Systems increases div.</headline>
<dateline>GIBSONIA, Pa. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Pittsburgh Systems Inc said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.14 per share from $0.13 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 15, to shareholders of record on April 1.</p>
</text>
